  "description": "Older core omits login_hint and still validates. Older consumer ignores the additive field. Consumer tests inject an unknown enum and unknown target type: suppress hint, keep row and normal connect flow; absent never means none. No unknown sender enum example is accepted by the current schema. Each named target has an exclusive tag equal to its id; filtered list reads select that row for the field-omission checks.",
